## Recipes

- **Single-file HTML page**: one self-contained `.html` (inline CSS/JS), one section per unit, images from `assets/`, knowledge checks as interactive questions that reveal feedback. Keep it accessible: semantic headings, alt text from the source, keyboard-operable controls.
- **Claude artifact / Codex preview**: start from `viewer.html` (already renders `course.json`) and restyle or extend it, or build the HTML page above.
- **Slide outline**: one slide per block group, speaker notes from the paragraph text, questions at the end of each unit.
- **Quiz bank**: export `questions.json` to CSV / GIFT / QTI, preserving correct flags and feedback.
- **Job aid / summary**: one page, which means about 400–600 words; each unit reduced to its key points, in order, citing unit numbers. Cut detail to stay inside the length rather than running over.
